        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Our approach includes embedding Sustainability and Environmental, Social and Governance (ESG) throughout our value chain and technology stack. We engage our supply chain to drive emissions reductions, use innovative materials and takeback programs to advance the circular economy and collaborate with nonprofits with the aim to bring everyone access to the benefits of technology.",
