        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Our FY24 ESG Report is one way we're holding ourselves accountable against our ambitious goals for 2030 and beyond, and we continue to invest in initiatives that apply our technology, scale and talented workforce to address complex challenges like climate change, accelerating the circular economy, creating inclusive workplaces and addressing the digital divide.\nOur FY24 highlights include:",
